body:
One of the only features missing in this app is for the software to recognize dates and other scheduling information imputed using its voice-to-text feature and apply them to the task&#39;s additional information.  Ex: &#34;Call Emily Filbert. May 3rd at 10am. Flag important. Reminder at 9am.&#34;  

Hopefully a feature like this will become available in a later release.

I love having push notification for my to do list on my phone because I basically always have it with me when I&#39;m on the go.

Just started using this app but have many other todo&#39;s and this one is 5 Star so far...
2 months later;
I wish however after using it now for 2 months that their was &#34;I&#39;ll get to it one day&#34; file where I could store ie procrastinate on some items that have become much less urgent but should not be forgotten. Just a suggestion..
